    },
    {
      "displayText": "皙白先生不在，\n这可是我的好机会。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7699767D5148751F4E0D5728FF0C000A8FD953EF662F62117684597D673A4F1A300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n虽说有些突然，但请你跟我打一场！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A867D8BF467094E9B7A817136FF0C4F468BF74F608DDF621162534E00573AFF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皙白先生不在的这段时间里，\n我想重新审视自己！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7699767D5148751F4E0D572876848FD96BB565F695F491CCFF0C000A621160F391CD65B05BA189C681EA5DF1FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好跟我对决了，\n就来说一声吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D8DDF62115BF951B34E86FF0C000A5C3167658BF44E0058F05427FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要跟我对决吗？\n还是要加强招式？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818DDF62115BF951B35417FF1F000A8FD8662F898152A05F3A62DB5F0FFF1F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对决！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF951B3FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "加强招式……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "52A05F3A62DB5F0F202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>你也有\n自己的安排……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF00100002010000004F604E5F6709000A81EA5DF176845B8963922026202600100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就请你这位ZA登峰战\nA级选手多多指教了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C318BF74F608FD94F4D005A0041767B5CF06218000A00417EA79009624B591A591A630765594E86FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要跟我对决吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818DDF62115BF951B35417FF1F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n你是密阿雷最强的训练家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F0010000201000000FF0C000A4F60662F5BC6963F96F767005F3A76848BAD7EC35BB6300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相比之下，\n我实在是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F86BD44E4B4E0BFF0C000A62115B9E5728662F2026202600100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我……\n一点都没有变强。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621120262026000A4E0070B990FD6CA1670953D85F3A300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样会把正义社……\n乃至皙白先生的声誉拉低的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374F1A628A6B634E49793E20262026000A4E4381F37699767D5148751F768458F08A8962C94F4E7684300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正义社真的需要\n我这样的人吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B634E49793E771F768497008981000A62118FD9683776844EBA5417FF1F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕嗷嗷！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549555F755F7FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕咿咿！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549554BF54BFFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那两个家伙是无赖兄弟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E244E2A5BB64F19662F65E08D5651445F1FFF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它们是一对无视野生特区，\n四处大闹的霸道熊猫。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834EEC662F4E005BF965E089C691CE751F7279533AFF0C000A56DB5904592795F9768497389053718A732B300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就连皙白先生也只能勉强赶走它们，\n是相当危险的宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C318FDE7699767D5148751F4E5F53EA80FD52C95F3A8D768D705B834EECFF0C000A662F76F85F535371966976845B9D53EF68A6300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但皙白先生不在的时候，\n守护道场的职责，就落在我小种身上了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F467699767D5148751F4E0D5728768465F65019FF0C000A5B8862A49053573A7684804C8D23FF0C5C31843D572862115C0F79CD8EAB4E0A4E86300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n请和我并肩战斗！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A8BF7548C62115E7680A962186597FF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n打得漂亮！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A62535F976F024EAEFF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕嗷？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "549555F7FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "霸道熊猫，\n回家的路在这边哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97389053718A732BFF0C000A56DE5BB676848DEF57288FD98FB954E6300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皙白先生。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7699767D5148751F300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>和小种啊。\n刚才的霸道熊猫们是怎么回事？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F0010000201000000548C5C0F79CD554A3002000A521A624D768497389053718A732B4EEC662F600E4E4856DE4E8BFF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是这样的！多亏<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>出面相助，\n我们把那两个来道场大闹的家伙赶走了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8FD968377684FF01591A4E8F001000020100000051FA976276F852A9FF0C000A62114EEC628A90A34E244E2A67659053573A592795F976845BB64F198D768D704E86300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我有幸窥见了<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā他她实力的冰山一角，\n真不愧是密阿雷的救世主。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167095E787AA589C14E8600100003110000FF01014ED659795B9E529B768451B05C714E0089D2FF0C000A771F4E0D6127662F5BC6963F96F7768465514E164E3B300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相比之下，\n我实在是……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F86BD44E4B4E0BFF0C000A62115B9E5728662F2026202600100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小种。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F79CD300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728300200100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你没有实力的话，\n是不可能和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>一起战斗的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F606CA167095B9E529B76848BDDFF0C000A662F4E0D53EF80FD548C00100002010000004E008D77621865977684300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我能抽开身来，\n正是因为有小种你守护道场。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14621180FD62BD5F008EAB6765FF0C000A6B63662F56E04E3A67095C0F79CD4F605B8862A49053573A300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和强者比较而自惭形秽，\n是你明白彼此间差距的证明。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C5F3A80056BD48F83800C81EA60ED5F6279FDFF0C000A662F4F60660E767D5F7C6B6495F45DEE8DDD76848BC1660E300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小种你会变得越来越强的。\n下次来和我一起驱赶霸道熊猫吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F79CD4F604F1A53D85F978D8A67658D8A5F3A76843002000A4E0B6B216765548C62114E008D779A718D7697389053718A732B5427300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662FFF0100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n今天真是太感谢你了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4ECA5929771F662F592A611F8C224F604E86FF0100100002011400330000",
